OL,3,GNEWSAMayor wants JLR on Merseyside for
OL,4,A50 more years
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Region Mayor Steve
OL,7,FRotheram will fly to India later this
OL,8,Fmonth to meet bosses at Tata Motors,
OL,9,Fthe parent company of Jaguar Land Rover
OL,10,F(JLR), to discuss the future of the car
OL,11,Fmaker's Halewood plant.
OL,13,FThe visit comes after JLR launched its
OL,14,Fnew all-electric Type 01 vehicle, which
OL,15,Fwill be partly built at the Knowsley
OL,16,Ffactory.
OL,18,FRotheram said he wanted to ensure the
OL,19,Fcompany remained in the city region for
OL,20,Fanother 50 years, describing JLR as "an
OL,21,Fintegral part of the ecosystem".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
